  {
   "id": "matematicas-2006-reserva-5-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera los puntos \\(A(2,1,2)\\) y \\(B(0,4,1)\\) y la recta \\(r\\) de ecuación \\(x=y-2=\\dfrac{z-3}2\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Determina un punto \\(C\\) de la recta \\(r\\) que equidiste de los puntos \\(A\\) y \\(B\\).",
     "(1 p.) Calcula el área del triángulo de vértices \\(ABC\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\equiv(t,\\,2+t,\\,3+2t)\\). Un punto \\(C\\) de \\(r\\) equidista de \\(A\\) y \\(B\\) si \\(|\\overrightarrow{CA}|^2=|\\overrightarrow{CB}|^2\\):</p>\\[(x-2)^2+(y-1)^2+(z-2)^2=x^2+(y-4)^2+(z-1)^2\\iff-4x+6y-2z=8\\iff-2x+3y-z=4\\]<p>(Es el plano mediador de \\(AB\\).) Sustituyo el punto de \\(r\\):</p>\\[-2t+3(2+t)-(3+2t)=4\\iff-t+3=4\\iff t=-1\\]<div class='res'>\\(C(-1,1,1)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}=(-2,3,-1),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AC}=(-3,0,-1),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-2&3&-1\\\\-3&0&-1\\end{vmatrix}=(-3,\\,1,\\,9)\\]\\[\\text{Área}=\\frac12\\sqrt{9+1+81}=\\frac{\\sqrt{91}}2\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":177,\"el\":50,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[2,1,2],[0,4,1],[-1,1,1]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[-1.8,0.2,-0.6],[0.8,2.8,4.6],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[0.8,2.8,4.6],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"pt\",[2,1,2],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,4,1],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-1,1,1],\"C\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m06r5a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m06r5a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m06r5a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m06r5a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='152.1,47.7 26.0,147.7 159.0,175.8' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='195.6' y1='246.0' x2='76.4' y2='18.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='82.4' y='18.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><circle cx='152.1' cy='47.7' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='159.1' y='41.7' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='26.0' cy='147.7' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='141.7' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='159.0' cy='175.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='166.0' y='169.8' font-weight='700'>C</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='23.2' y2='257.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='19.9' y='257.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='8.0' y2='270.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='-0.6' y='274.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='259.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='260.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{91}}2\\approx4{,}77\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
