  {
   "id": "matematicas-2006-reserva-5-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean las funciones \\(f\\) y \\(g:[0,+\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R\\), dadas por \\(f(x)=x^2\\) y \\(g(x)=\\lambda\\sqrt x\\), donde \\(\\lambda\\) es un número real positivo fijo. Calcula el valor de \\(\\lambda\\) sabiendo que el área del recinto limitado por las gráficas de ambas funciones es \\(\\frac13\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Cortes: \\(x^2=\\lambda\\sqrt x\\Rightarrow x^4=\\lambda^2x\\iff x(x^3-\\lambda^2)=0\\iff x=0\\) o \\(x=\\lambda^{2/3}\\). Llamo \\(c=\\lambda^{2/3}\\) (así \\(c^{3/2}=\\lambda\\) y \\(c^3=\\lambda^2\\)). Entre 0 y \\(c\\), \\(\\lambda\\sqrt x\\) va por encima:</p>\\[A=\\int_0^c\\left(\\lambda x^{1/2}-x^2\\right)dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{2\\lambda}3x^{3/2}-\\frac{x^3}3\\Bigr]_0^c=\\frac{2\\lambda}3\\lambda-\\frac{\\lambda^2}3=\\frac{\\lambda^2}3\\]\\[\\frac{\\lambda^2}3=\\frac13\\iff\\lambda=1\\ (\\lambda\\gt0)\\]<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='63.3,178.8 66.9,162.1 70.6,155.1 74.2,149.8 77.8,145.3 81.4,141.4 85.0,137.8 88.6,134.5 92.2,131.5 95.8,128.6 99.4,125.9 103.1,123.3 106.7,120.8 110.3,118.5 113.9,116.2 117.5,114.0 121.1,111.9 124.7,109.8 128.3,107.8 131.9,105.8 135.6,104.0 139.2,102.1 142.8,100.3 146.4,98.5 150.0,96.8 153.6,95.1 157.2,93.5 160.8,91.8 164.4,90.2 168.1,88.7 171.7,87.1 175.3,85.6 178.9,84.1 182.5,82.7 186.1,81.2 189.7,79.8 193.3,78.4 196.9,77.0 200.6,75.6 204.2,74.3 207.8,72.9 207.8,72.9 204.2,78.2 200.6,83.3 196.9,88.2 193.3,93.1 189.7,97.8 186.1,102.3 182.5,106.8 178.9,111.1 175.3,115.2 171.7,119.3 168.1,123.2 164.4,126.9 160.8,130.6 157.2,134.1 153.6,137.5 150.0,140.7 146.4,143.8 142.8,146.8 139.2,149.6 135.6,152.4 131.9,154.9 128.3,157.4 124.7,159.7 121.1,161.9 117.5,163.9 113.9,165.9 110.3,167.6 106.7,169.3 103.1,170.8 99.4,172.2 95.8,173.5 92.2,174.6 88.6,175.6 85.0,176.4 81.4,177.2 77.8,177.8 74.2,178.2 70.6,178.6 66.9,178.8 63.3,178.8' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='63.3,178.8 66.9,162.1 70.6,155.1 74.2,149.8 77.8,145.3 81.4,141.4 85.0,137.8 88.6,134.5 92.2,131.5 95.8,128.6 99.4,125.9 103.1,123.3 106.7,120.8 110.3,118.5 113.9,116.2 117.5,114.0 121.1,111.9 124.7,109.8 128.3,107.8 131.9,105.8 135.6,104.0 139.2,102.1 142.8,100.3 146.4,98.5 150.0,96.8 153.6,95.1 157.2,93.5 160.8,91.8 164.4,90.2 168.1,88.7 171.7,87.1 175.3,85.6 178.9,84.1 182.5,82.7 186.1,81.2 189.7,79.8 193.3,78.4 196.9,77.0 200.6,75.6 204.2,74.3 207.8,72.9 211.4,71.6 215.0,70.3 218.6,69.0 222.2,67.8 225.8,66.5 229.4,65.3 233.1,64.0 236.7,62.8 240.3,61.6 243.9,60.4 247.5,59.3 251.1,58.1 254.7,56.9 258.3,55.8 261.9,54.7 265.6,53.5 269.2,52.4 272.8,51.3 276.4,50.2 280.0,49.1' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,169.3 23.6,170.8 27.2,172.2 30.8,173.5 34.4,174.6 38.1,175.6 41.7,176.4 45.3,177.2 48.9,177.8 52.5,178.2 56.1,178.6 59.7,178.8 63.3,178.8 66.9,178.8 70.6,178.6 74.2,178.2 77.8,177.8 81.4,177.2 85.0,176.4 88.6,175.6 92.2,174.6 95.8,173.5 99.4,172.2 103.1,170.8 106.7,169.3 110.3,167.6 113.9,165.9 117.5,163.9 121.1,161.9 124.7,159.7 128.3,157.4 131.9,154.9 135.6,152.4 139.2,149.6 142.8,146.8 146.4,143.8 150.0,140.7 153.6,137.5 157.2,134.1 160.8,130.6 164.4,126.9 168.1,123.2 171.7,119.3 175.3,115.2 178.9,111.1 182.5,106.8 186.1,102.3 189.7,97.8 193.3,93.1 196.9,88.2 200.6,83.3 204.2,78.2 207.8,72.9 211.4,67.6 215.0,62.1 218.6,56.5 222.2,50.7 225.8,44.8 229.4,38.8 233.1,32.6 236.7,26.4' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='207.8' cy='72.9' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='213.8' y='82.9'>(1,1)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 178.8H294.0M63.3 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='207.8' y1='175.8' x2='207.8' y2='181.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='204.8' y='192.8' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='60.3' y1='72.9' x2='66.3' y2='72.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='47.3' y='76.9' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div><div class='res'>\\(\\lambda=1\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "area",
     "apartados": ""
