  {
   "id": "matematicas-2006-reserva-5-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Halla la ecuación de un plano que sea paralelo al plano \\(\\pi\\) de ecuación \\(x+y+z=1\\) y forme con los ejes de coordenadas un triángulo de área \\(18\\sqrt3\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Un plano paralelo a \\(\\pi\\) es \\(x+y+z=k\\) (\\(k\\neq0\\)). Corta a los ejes en \\(P_1(k,0,0)\\), \\(P_2(0,k,0)\\), \\(P_3(0,0,k)\\):</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{P_1P_2}=(-k,k,0),\\quad\\overrightarrow{P_1P_3}=(-k,0,k),\\quad\\overrightarrow{P_1P_2}\\times\\overrightarrow{P_1P_3}=(k^2,\\,k^2,\\,k^2)\\]\\[\\text{Área}=\\frac12\\sqrt{3k^4}=\\frac{\\sqrt3}2k^2=18\\sqrt3\\iff k^2=36\\iff k=\\pm6\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":45,\"el\":36,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[6,0,0],[0,6,0],[0,0,6]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[7.5,0.0,0.0],\"#94a3b8\",1.4,false],[\"txt\",[7.5,0.0,0.0],\"X\",\"#94a3b8\",6,0],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[0.0,7.5,0.0],\"#94a3b8\",1.4,false],[\"txt\",[0.0,7.5,0.0],\"Y\",\"#94a3b8\",6,0],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[0.0,0.0,7.5],\"#94a3b8\",1.4,false],[\"txt\",[0.0,0.0,7.5],\"Z\",\"#94a3b8\",6,0],[\"pt\",[6,0,0],\"P₁\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,6,0],\"P₂\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,0,6],\"P₃\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m06r5b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m06r5b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m06r5b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m06r5b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='52.3,230.5 263.0,230.5 157.6,48.1' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='157.6' y1='168.6' x2='26.0' y2='246.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4'/><text x='32.0' y='246.0' fill='#94a3b8' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>X</text><line x1='157.6' y1='168.6' x2='289.3' y2='246.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4'/><text x='295.3' y='246.0' fill='#94a3b8' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>Y</text><line x1='157.6' y1='168.6' x2='157.6' y2='18.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4'/><text x='163.6' y='18.0' fill='#94a3b8' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>Z</text><circle cx='52.3' cy='230.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='59.3' y='224.5' font-weight='700'>P₁</text><circle cx='263.0' cy='230.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='270.0' y='224.5' font-weight='700'>P₂</text><circle cx='157.6' cy='48.1' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='164.6' y='42.1' font-weight='700'>P₃</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='12.7' y2='276.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='5.7' y='283.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='35.3' y2='276.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.3' y='283.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='257.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='256.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(x+y+z=6\\) (también sirve \\(x+y+z=-6\\))</div></div>"
    }
